theorem Th38:
digits(120,10) = <%0,2,1%>
proof
  set d=<%0,2,1%>;
  set e=<%0*10|^0,2*10|^1,1*10|^2%>;
  A1: Sum e = Sum (<%0*10|^0,2*10|^1%>)+Sum(<%1*10|^2%>) by AFINSQ_2:55
  .= ((0*10|^0)+(2*10|^1))+Sum(<%1*10|^2%>) by AFINSQ_2:54
