theorem Th186:
digits(128,10) = <%8,2,1%>
proof
  set d=<%8,2,1%>;
  set e=<%8*10|^0,2*10|^1,1*10|^2%>;
  A1: Sum e = Sum (<%8*10|^0,2*10|^1%>)+Sum(<%1*10|^2%>) by AFINSQ_2:55
