theorem Th216:
digits(432,10) = <%2,3,4%>
proof
  set d=<%2,3,4%>;
  set e=<%2*10|^0,3*10|^1,4*10|^2%>;
  A1: Sum e = Sum (<%2*10|^0,3*10|^1%>)+Sum(<%4*10|^2%>) by AFINSQ_2:55
  .= ((2*10|^0)+(3*10|^1))+Sum(<%4*10|^2%>) by AFINSQ_2:54
