theorem Th743:
digits(315,10) = <%5,1,3%>
proof
  set d=<%5,1,3%>;
  set e=<%5*10|^0,1*10|^1,3*10|^2%>;
  A1: Sum e = Sum (<%5*10|^0,1*10|^1%>)+Sum(<%3*10|^2%>) by AFINSQ_2:55
