  .= Sum (<%8*10|^0,7*10|^1%>)+Sum(<%1*10|^2%>)+Sum(<%2*10|^3%>) by AFINSQ_2:55
  .= ((8*10|^0)+(7*10|^1))+Sum(<%1*10|^2%>)+Sum(<%2*10|^3%>) by AFINSQ_2:54
  .= ((8*10|^0)+(7*10|^1))+(1*10|^2)+Sum(<%2*10|^3%>) by AFINSQ_2:53
  .= ((8*10|^0)+(7*10|^1))+(1*10|^2)+(2*10|^3) by AFINSQ_2:53
  .= 8*1 + 7*(10|^1) + 1*(10|^2) + 2*(10|^3) by NEWTON:4
