  .= Sum (<%0*10|^0,0*10|^1%>)+Sum(<%7*10|^2%>)+Sum(<%4*10|^3%>) by AFINSQ_2:55
  .= ((0*10|^0)+(0*10|^1))+Sum(<%7*10|^2%>)+Sum(<%4*10|^3%>) by AFINSQ_2:54
  .= ((0*10|^0)+(0*10|^1))+(7*10|^2)+Sum(<%4*10|^3%>) by AFINSQ_2:53
